    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Beautiful townhouse located just a short walk to town centre. No.58 is an extended and renovated traditional townhouse presented in superb condition throughout. Having undergone complete upgrade in 2018, the property now offers open comfortable living space and yet retaining much of the original character and charm. Accommodation includes open plan sitting/living space, kitchen with double doors to rear garden. 3 bedrooms, master with ensuite and family bathroom. The rear garden is a rear delight, laid out in a courtyard style, it is enclosed by original stone walls and is not overlooked. Just 2 minute walk to bus stop with excellent services to Dublin and close to walkway and park along river Boyne. Viewing highly recommended.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: 2.76 x 0.94\r\nSitting room/Living room: 6.14 x 5.81\r\nTiled floor, feature fireplace with gas stove, spot lights\r\nstaircase with glass panels\r\nKitchen: 5.39 x 3.23\r\nFitted gloss units & breakfast bar, integrated fridge freezer, cooker-hob,\r\nfrench doors to garden, spot lights\r\n1st Floor\r\nLanding: glass paneled balustrade, exposed stone feature wall\r\nBedroom 1: 2.92 x 3.91\r\nFitted wardrobes, laminate wood floor, stira stairs to attic\r\nBedroom 2: 5.80 x 3.21\r\nLaminate wood floor, built in wardrobes\r\nEnsuite: 3.29 x 1.32\r\nDouble shower, wc, whb, towel heater, tiled floor & shower area\r\nBedroom 3: 2.07 x 3.27\r\nLaminate wood floor\r\nBathroom: 2.13 x 1.78\r\nBath, wc, whb, towel heater, tiled floor & bath area.\r\n\r\nExterior:\r\n1. large courtyard style rear garden\r\n2. Enclosed by vintage stone walls\r\n3. Not overlooked\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n1. Combi gas fired central heating\r\n2. upvc double glazed windows and doors\r\n3. Completely renovated and extended in 2018"
      },
